index=['# BHR remaining-pages plan index\n\n','**Planning complete; implementation has not started.** The user requested the project listing and all eight detail pages, contact, appointment, then the remaining sitemap pages. This index links one plan for each of the **64 scoped paths**, plus shared foundations.\n\n','1920×1080 remains primary. All pages have primary live evidence; the 11 priority pages also have 1440×900, 768×1024 and 390×844 baselines. Other responsive views are explicit implementation prerequisites. 32 paths currently have no local page.\n\n','[Design and decisions](../specs/2026-11-20-bhr-remaining-pages-design.md) · [Shared foundations]('+SHARED+') · [Visual evidence and all measurements](../../../checks/visual-planning-2026-11-20/README.md) · [Interactive comparisons](../../../checks/visual-planning-2026-11-20/comparison-gallery.html) · [Planning review](../../../checks/visual-planning-2026-11-20/plan-review.md)\n\n','## Execution order and dependencies\n\n','Use native execution with one fresh final review, as in the previous phase: the pages share route, media, style and form interfaces, so repeated per-page agent contexts add cost and conflict. Page numbers identify plans; follow their listed prerequisites.\n\n','1. Shared foundations with an empty manifest, then the Privacy (54) and not-found (48) support pages.\n2. The 11 priority pages below.\n3. Standalone quote (46) and Productie-industrie (20) before service pages; the two bordenbouw destinations before Bordenbouwer (15); root careers (63) before the HTML sitemap (56).\n4. Remaining page families. Deliver the location directory and its nine details (35–44) as one functional batch because index cards and breadcrumbs form a cycle; retain ten independent visual results.\n5. All four widths, applicable interaction states, full tests/link audit, protected hashes and a final source refresh/review. A failing page/width keeps that strict gate open.\n\n','Full graph: [link-dependencies.json](../../../checks/visual-planning-2026-11-20/link-dependencies.json). Do not add placeholder pages or weaken verification to break dependencies.\n\n','## Priority pages\n\n','| # | Page | Local baseline | Plan | Visual evidence |\n|---:|---|---|---|---|\n']
